1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,879
Uni hamma Shahzoda deb taniydi.

2
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:03,940
Lekin bu uning asl ismi emas.

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:06,160
Haqiqiy ismi Zilola Musayeva.

4
00:00:06,299 --> 00:00:11,000
U 1979-yilning 28-iyulida Toshkentda tug'ilgan.

5
00:00:11,279 --> 00:00:14,039
Sahnaga birinchi qadamini «Jonim» guruhida qo'ygan.

6
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,759
Lekin guruh uzoq yashamadi,

7
00:00:15,839 --> 00:00:17,980
va 2000-yilda tarqalib ketdi.

8
00:00:18,199 --> 00:00:20,940
Shundan keyin Zilola yolg'iz kuylashga qaror qildi.

9
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:23,100
Birinchi qo'shig'i «Yurak sezar» bo'ldi.

10
00:00:23,339 --> 00:00:25,679
Ko'p o'tmay uni butun O'zbekiston tanidi.

11
00:00:25,899 --> 00:00:28,199
2003-yili «Tarona» taqdimotida

12
00:00:28,199 --> 00:00:31,039
yilning eng yaxshi ayol xonandasi deb topildi.

13
00:00:31,079 --> 00:00:34,560
2005-yili esa «Kerakmisan» yil qo'shig'i bo'ldi.

14
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:37,359
Bu qo'shiqni hozir ham yoddan biladiganlar ko'p.

15
00:00:37,619 --> 00:00:39,420
Shahzoda faqat o'zbekcha emas,

16
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:42,859
ruscha, forscha, qozoqcha, tojikcha

17
00:00:42,859 --> 00:00:44,840
va hatto inglizcha ham qo'shiq aytgan.

18
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,200
Kinoda ham o'ynagan.

19
00:00:46,399 --> 00:00:48,979
«Sevinch» filmida bosh rolni o'zi ijro etgan.

20
00:00:49,119 --> 00:00:50,460
Yana bir qiziq gap.

21
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:53,219
2013-yili u Turkvision tanlovida

22
00:00:53,219 --> 00:00:55,179
O'zbekiston nomidan qatnashishi kerak edi.

23
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,179
Ammo oxirida uning o'rniga

24
00:00:57,179 --> 00:00:58,179
Nilufar Usmonova chiqdi.

25
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:01,219
Sizga Shahzodaning qaysi qo'shig'i yoqadi?

26
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,740
Izohda yozib qoldiring!

